{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-62606-r4522771","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Chunky Cran Apple Bran Muffins","sourcePageId":62606,"sourceRevision":"4522771","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-07-11T19:48:06Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Chunky%20Cran%20Apple%20Bran%20Muffins&oldid=4522771","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:38:16.285Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Baking recipes","Category:Easy recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for muffins","Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour","Category:Recipes using apple","Category:Recipes using baking powder","Category:Recipes using baking soda","Category:Recipes using bran","Category:Recipes using brown sugar","Category:Recipes using clove","Category:Recipes using cow milk","Category:Recipes using cranberry","Category:Recipes using egg","Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon","Category:Recipes with metric units"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"9624d8a669d95541a9ce34b06a7668318f4f118cedbc68f9837fe4b6fc8cd84f","sourceWikitext":"{{recipesummary|category=Breakfast recipes|servings=8|time=20–25 minutes|difficulty=2\n}}\n\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Breakfast Recipes|Breakfast Recipes]]\n\nA tasty [[Cookbook:Muffin|muffin]] recipe with apple chunks and dried cranberries.\n\n==Ingredients==\n* ¾ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (180 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]]) natural wheat bran\n* ¾ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (180 g) [[Cookbook:Milk|milk]]\n* 1 ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (360 g) [[Cookbook:Flour|all-purpose flour]]\n* 1 ½ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Baking Powder|baking powder]]\n* 1 ½ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Cinnamon|cinnamon]]\n* ¾ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* ¼ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Baking Soda|baking soda]]\n* ⅛ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Clove|cloves]]\n* ¾ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (180 g) [[Cookbook:Brown Sugar|brown sugar]]\n* ⅓ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (80 [[Cookbook:Milliliter|ml]]) [[Cookbook:Vegetable oil|vegetable oil]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Egg|egg]]\n* 1 ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (360 g) [[Cookbook:Apple|chopped, peeled apples]]\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (120 g) dried [[Cookbook:Cranberry|cranberries]]\n\n==Procedure==\n#Combine bran and milk into a [[Cookbook:Mixing Bowl|mixing bowl]]. Let rest for 5 minutes.\n#Combine flour, baking powder, cinnamon, salt, baking soda and nutmeg in another [[Cookbook:Mixing Bowl|mixing bowl]].\n#Stir brown sugar, cooking oil, and egg into the bran mixture. Stir in dried ingredients, apples and cranberries.\n#Spoon batter into greased [[Cookbook:Muffin Pan|muffin cups]].\n#Fill muffin cups ¾ full. Bake at [[Cookbook:Oven temperatures|400°F]] (200°C) for 15 to 20 minutes, or until tester comes out clean.\n\n==Notes, tips and variations==\n*For an optional topping, add 2 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoons]] of granulated sugar and ¼ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] of cinnamon to the batter when they are in the muffin cups.\n*These taste best when still warm.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for muffins]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cranberry]]\n[[Category:Recipes using apple]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bran]]\n[[Category:Baking recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes_with_metric_units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bakin